# The install from the SPUN zip, with no spun.cat: the zip's files in
# /apps/zip, where spun.bas starts. It runs that spun.dot with get spun
# against the test server: y takes the suggested /apps/wifi/spun, and no
# overwrite is asked. Then it erases spun.dot, and the menu waits.
# mame-repair.sh checks spun.cat and the files after the run. No noreset:
# NextZXOS runs from $0000 with ROM paged in at the LOAD and at the menu's
# OPEN #4 of line 20, and neither is a reset.
put @SPUN@ /apps/zip/spun.dot
put @BAS@ /apps/zip/spun.bas
autostart CD "c:/apps/zip"
autostart LOAD "spun.bas"
seconds 45
key 18 y
snap 15 18 21 24 30 44
screen 44 Install an app
